                    <chunk name="param_input" index="0">
                      <items count="10">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Which climate file to use. Click the widget and choose Browse library… to pick from the catalog with a map and a spec sheet; the value stored is the file's own name (e.g. DEU_BE_Berlin-Tempelhof.AP.103840_TMYx.2009-2023). A station name, WMO id, country or dataset year still works as a search — the best match nearest the site wins — and a direct EPW or ZIP URL is downloaded as-is.</item>
